#: {{ux|en|'''toggle''' to lower/upper case}}
#: {{ux|en|You can quickly '''toggle''' the case of selected text by pressing Alt+C.}}
#* {{RQ:en:New York Times|date=2022-10-22|author=w:Maureen Dowd|title=Ralph Fiennes, Master of Monsters|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2022/10/22/style/ralph-fiennes-robert-moses.html|passage=He’s that rare creature who’s equally powerful in the classics and popular fare, who’s dedicated to '''toggling''' between stage and screen. He is both prolific and enigmatic, disappearing into a dazzling range of characters.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250930220635/https://www.nytimes.com/2022/10/22/style/ralph-fiennes-robert-moses.html|archivedate=30 September 2025}}
